silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_24_rosetta_stone_cross_domain_sections_06_six_step_scaffold_exposition_concrete_anchor_7#mittens silm:hasLongDescription "The Mittens is the unifying concrete individual: microchip 985112345678901, body mass 4.2 kg -- the apex that all five domain readings agree on. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Mittens', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
